<view class="wrap">
 <view class="card">
  <view class="heading">七项核销 · {{title}}</view>
  <view class="muted">与云服务器测试版共用核销结果；手机端只读展示，不能绕过原件人工核验。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="muted">正在读取核销资料…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{steps.length}}" class="field">已通过 {{passed}} / {{total}} 项 · {{complete?'核销已完成':'核销未完成'}} · 未决例外 {{openExceptions}}</view>
 </view>
 <view wx:if="{{steps.length}}" class="card">
  <view class="section-caption">选择核销步骤</view>
  <view wx:for="{{steps}}" wx:key="no" data-no="{{item.no}}" bindtap="selectStep"
   class="item {{selectedNo===item.no?'verify-active':''}}">
   <view class="row"><text>第 {{item.no}} 项 · {{item.name}}</text><text class="tag">{{item.displayResult}}</text></view>
  </view>
 </view>
 <view wx:if="{{selected}}" class="card">
  <view class="section-caption">第 {{selected.no}} 项 · {{selected.name}}</view>
  <view class="field">判定结果：{{selected.displayResult}}</view>
  <view class="muted">以下文件来自已授权项目的材料库。终版议程仅显示当前已确认的终版原件。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!canViewFiles}}" class="empty-state">当前账号可查看核销进度，但没有本项目原件查看权限。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{canViewFiles&&!files.length}}" class="empty-state">暂无可关联的有效原件，请在材料中心补充，或通过网页端查看其他结构化业务凭证。</view>
  <view wx:for="{{files}}" wx:key="id" class="item">
   <view class="title">{{item.kind}} · {{item.name}}</view>
   <view class="muted">{{item.fileName}} {{item.version}}</view>
   <button class="btn ghost" size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="viewOriginal">查看原件</button>
  </view>
  <view class="muted">第 1 项关联盖章函件、终版议程与串场。OCR 仅辅助比对，判定与例外处理请由有权限人员在网页端完成。</view>
 </view>
</view>